src="https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2025/3/c1f3adb1-ff8e-4167-9e41-9d75e7a16c5e.png?x-bce-process=image/format,f_auto" title="380 → 90 元破冰新低：悦木之源 200ml 灵芝水京东 3 折刚需闭眼囤" width="1440" /></p><ul class=" list-paddingleft-2"><li><p>先领 200 元大额券：<a href="https://coupon.m.jd.com/coupons/show.action?linkKey=AAROH_xIpeffAs_-naABEFoeBJ9OHT9XGkGQVtdsIWH7kC3L6u25J4KVa049IPrE2XLrBq_16QpIyFKZbK2CREWzvIhRhA" target="_blank">点此领券</a></p></li></ul><dir><a contenteditable="false" href="https://u.jd.com/k6qakid" target="_blank"><span class="card main-site"><span class="card-logo"><img height="800" src="https://img14.360buyimg.com/pop/jfs/t1/474164/28/17936/41135/6a59c83aF7737dc7d/0083320320d9c438.jpg" title="380 → 90 元破冰新低：悦木之源 200ml 灵芝水京东 3 折刚需闭眼囤" width="800" /></span><span class="card-info"><span class="card-title"><span class="mall-data">京东</span><span class="card-name">悦木之源 灵芝菌菇水 200ml</span></span><span class="card-abstract"> 送 100ml*2 瓶 京东真自营</span><span class="card-controls"><span class="price">折后 180 元</span><span class="card-btn-deep">直达链接</span></span></span></span></a></dir><p class="ad-tips">广告声明：文内含有的对外跳转链接（包括不限于超链接、二维码、口令等形式），用于传递更多信息，节省甄选时间，结果仅供参考，IT之家包含外链的文章均包含本声明。</p><div class="tagging1">【广告】</div>
